sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API Server
    box rgba(100, 100, 255, 0.1) Control Plane
        participant EG as Envoy Gateway Controller
    end
    box rgba(100, 255, 100, 0.1) Data Plane
        participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy
    end

    note over EG, Envoy: Pre-condition: Long-lived gRPC xDS stream established

    %% Step 1: User action
    User->>K8s: kubectl apply (e.g., HTTPRoute)
    activate K8s

    %% Step 2: Reconciliation trigger
    K8s-->>EG: Watch Event (Resource detected/modified)
    deactivate K8s

    %% Step 3: Internal processing loop
    activate EG
    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        note right of EG: **Reconciliation Loop**
        EG->>EG: 1. Read state of Gateway API resources & dependencies from K8s Cache
        EG->>EG: 2. Translate K8s Resources into Intermediate Representation (Infra IR)
        EG->>EG: 3. Generate final xDS Resources (Listeners, Clusters, Routes)
        note right of EG: *Leveraging go-control-plane libraries*
    end

    %% Step 4: The push
    EG->>Envoy: xDS Push (gRPC DiscoveryResponse containing new config)
    deactivate EG

    %% Step 5: Data plane update
    activate Envoy
    note left of Envoy: Proxy validates and dynamically hot-reloads config
    Envoy-->>EG: xDS ACK (DiscoveryRequest with new config version hash)
    deactivate Envoy

    note over Envoy: Ready to handle traffic with new rules
